 -n -- '--quiet' \"$S\"` shows a boolean assignment and a renderer call only.\n- [ ] CHK-131 [P1] Dependency licenses: no dependency is added. Verify: `git diff --stat` names one file.\n<!-- /ANCHOR:compliance-verify -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:docs-verify -->\n## L3+: Documentation Verification\n\n- [ ] CHK-140 [P1] All spec documents are synchronized. Verify: `rg -n -- '--quiet' spec.md plan.md tasks.md acceptance-criteria.md` names the same flag in all four.\n- [ ] CHK-141 [P1] API documentation: N/A - this is a CLI, and the `--help` text is its contract.\n- [ ] CHK-142 [P2] User-facing documentation updated. Verify: `bash \"$S\" --help` lists `--quiet` in the OPTIONS block.\n- [ ] CHK-143 [P2] Knowledge transfer documented. Verify: ADR-001 and ADR-002 in plan.md carry the reasoning a later editor needs.\n<!-- /ANCHOR:docs-verify -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:sign-off -->\n## L3+: Sign-Off\n\nN/A - this packet has no named human approver. The dispatch that commissioned it fixed the level and the scope, and that record lives in the packet metadata rather than in a signature row.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:sign-off -->\n","_meta":{"cognition.ai/linesAdded":1,"cognition.ai/linesRemoved":1}}],"locations":[{"path":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w8f3d32b7e3/tree/specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/tasks.md"}],"rawInput":{"file_path":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w8f3d32b7e3/tree/specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/tasks.md"},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"edit"}}
