{"toolCallId":"call_fdea8c7152f047b3abea8f2c52172e06","title":"Ran node","kind":"execute","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"resource","resource":{"mimeType":"text/x-shellscript","text":"node -e \"\nconst fs=require('fs');\nconst j=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/lib/validator-registry.json','utf8'));\nconst hit=j.filter(x=>/decision-record|FILE_EXISTS/i.test(JSON.stringify(x)));\nfor (const h of hit) console.log(JSON.stringify(h,null,1).slice(0,1200));\n\"","uri":"tool://preview"},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/preview_is_shell_command":true}}}],"rawInput":{"command":"node -e \"\nconst fs=require('fs');\nconst j=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/lib/validator-registry.json','utf8'));\nconst hit=j.filter(x=>/decision-record|FILE_EXISTS/i.test(JSON.stringify(x)));\nfor (const h of hit) console.log(JSON.stringify(h,null,1).slice(0,1200));\n\"","workdir":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w8f3d32b7e3/tree"},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/commandNames":["node"],"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
